<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36568" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαιρ-ετέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be taken out</i> or <i>removed,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς στρατιᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					2.2.23
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαιρετέον</span>
			<i>one must take out, remove,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἀναρχίαν ἐκ παντὸς τοῦ βίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					942c
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tht.</u>
				157b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>one must pick out, select,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				4.5.52
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
